name: StashKit — Privacy DNS through selected proxy
desc: >-
  Optional privacy preference only after adding a live node and selecting Proxy.
  Routes public AliDNS DoH by Proxy; bootstrap/node DNS and LAN system DNS remain direct.
dns:
  follow-rule: true
# Stash merges override rule arrays ahead of the main rules.
# This explicit DoH endpoint route prevents ChinaDirect matching it first.
rules:
  - DOMAIN,dns.alidns.com,Proxy
